<title>UK: Deutsche unit adds 1.0 trln lire to 2006 bond.</title>
<headline>Deutsche unit adds 1.0 trln lire to 2006 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond increase was announced by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE FINANCE NETHERLAND BV</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  DEUTSCHE BANK AG</p>
<p> AMT   *4.0 TRLN LIRE COUPON     ZERO	MATURITY    15.OCT.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  UNDISCL   PAY DATE    15.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UNDISC    REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	+=</p>
<p> NOTES     *ORIGINALLY LAUNCHED FOR 2.0 TRILLION ON THE</p>
<p>		11.SEP.96 AND INCREASED BY A FURTHER 1.0 TRILLION ON</p>
<p>		25.SEP.96.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
